<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-21T01:46:28.421Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 01:46:28 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen in Plateau killed NSCDC officer Distu Garba Audu and abducted a businessman, while separate gunmen attacks on herders in the same state left two dead and six injured. In Kaduna, bandits abducted five people, including a one-month-old baby, and a fisherman reported his fingers were cut off by bandits. Police freed a Catholic priest and seven other abductees in Benue. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxQOTNUWmNwY0ZLMlE2RnkyRmlBZEJhdEpubWVSdXpXOEw4eHhHTWp3dUdRTUI1ZnFubWduWWRhVWNuQWgydmQzZVNMZUpYcV90Y01DNFF2aFRzdmQ2MlZvb2VlZDZGMDBFZ0xoMGhlcWNSNUM5UjJyaTJ1d1BOR0NrNjZTZDBtR3EwdXNLVlln?oc=5&quot;&gt;Punch Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMickFVX3lxTFBQSDZGaV9nN05xM2huRkxEMDVCWURoUGFJZThxd0hIOUNRS1QtMGxDcEQtR0FkUEdFWnJOVlJaSmZkejVJeHNCaHE3LVhiZHlHYVoyOXFISWlwZGRDQUdBVlpVcEZUd2sxN1FZbmY4aTNIZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;APAnews - Agence de Presse Africaine&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxNWE9hOHltMFEteTBuLUFDZzl2MV8xTzFZdVVPRHB1SkdQNjZRdzVsZ0c2RjlNZ2hqMlJwb3ZuOWY0eE1ubmhyV1VNaWo4YUozY0RXeEVHalVhbGhqU3JSVmJJY0NtMjNxNkg5aXZ3ZXktS1hpcy1yTk5Sd1ZfZlpjcjRpSTl4UQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Trust&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNZjV1Z2ljSDd4TkxsRHVzZTJ3NlVDNllMVk5GYl9uOTRUaDc1QnJXQ0ozVl9mSENrZi05T29XMS1GekZIM0xNbGNKakVLbndMNFBBeGRNNmxhSWhhN1gyWDBrSGtkMEdTU1Q5TVhoOElldG1ieTlpbHczYm1MQk1TTWNfS2tkNUpBOVpfTzF0aXMxWVNpOXlsYVIwNUxSZHRCYjlfY3FyeUpiWG1SWGhnRUZR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sahara Reporters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxQenpLR1p1UWNoR3p0Y1g5VG9MN2RyTjlXSVhsSE4tV0hMMnBPWlVQMExyX2t6WXhVb2JmY2V6aGZXZjNLZ3RBQnVqSV9USkRuUnYwMVFrREV0a2pyQmVKR3RZSlZMYk